<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of harvest progress to Sunday.</p>
<p>CROP	    PCT SWATHED    PCT COMBINED</p>
<p>	   Aug 17/97 92/96 Avg Aug 17/97 92/96 Avg</p>
<p>W. Wheat   16 pct   26 pct    51 pct    22 pct</p>
<p>S. Wheat    8 pct    2 pct     1 pct     0 pct</p>
<p>Durum Wheat 7 pct    2 pct     1 pct     0 pct</p>
<p>Oats	  6 pct    3 pct     1 pct     0 pct</p>
<p>Barley     13 pct    3 pct     2 pct     0 pct</p>
<p>Fall Rye   16 pct   36 pct    77 pct    45 pct</p>
<p>Spring Rye 14 pct   11 pct     5 pct     4 pct</p>
<p>Flax	  2 pct    0 pct     0 pct     0 pct</p>
<p>Canola     39 pct    8 pct     2 pct     0 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters Bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
